## AccessControl.sol - Role Management

### Overview

Implements role-based access control with role hierarchy.

### Implementation

```solidity
library AccessControl {
    bytes32 public constant MANAGER_ROLE = keccak256("MANAGER");
    bytes32 public constant KEEPER_ROLE = keccak256("KEEPER");
    bytes32 public constant GOVERNANCE_ROLE = keccak256("GOVERNANCE");
    
    function hasRole(
        mapping(bytes32 => mapping(address => bool)) storage roles,
        bytes32 role,
        address account
    ) internal view returns (bool) {
        return roles[role][account];
    }
    
    function grantRole(
        mapping(bytes32 => mapping(address => bool)) storage roles,
        bytes32 role,
        address account
    ) internal {
        roles[role][account] = true;
    }
    
    function revokeRole(
        mapping(bytes32 => mapping(address => bool)) storage roles,
        bytes32 role,
        address account
    ) internal {
        roles[role][account] = false;
    }
}
```

Usage in contracts:
```solidity
mapping(bytes32 => mapping(address => bool)) private _roles;

modifier onlyManager() {
    require(
        AccessControl.hasRole(_roles, AccessControl.MANAGER_ROLE, msg.sender),
        "Not manager"
    );
    _;
}
```

